HB0220 Conservation easements-amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Ottman, Eklund, Hoeft, McCann and
Winter and Senator(s) Hutchings, Laursen, D and
Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to property, conveyances and security transactions; limiting
the duration of conservation easements to thirty (30) years; providing
definitions; making conforming amendments; specifying applicability; and
providing for an effective date.
1/16/2025 Bill Number Assigned
